{
    "name": "E2E RoomPriceGenie - create account",
    "description": "Asks RoomPriceGenie for a new pending account with Create Account and checks that credentials come back.",
    "notes": {
        "13e7eeaf-668e-4d4e-a65b-62364b7f1ff2": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 208,
            "width": 880,
            "height": 320,
            "content": "## Never run\n\nThis flow was written from RoomPriceGenie's documentation and has only passed `appmixer e2e validate`. No RoomPriceGenie test account existed when it was written. See README.md in this folder for what a run needs.\n\n## ⚠️ Every run creates a real pending account\n\nCreate Account asks RoomPriceGenie for a new account and RoomPriceGenie emails an activation link to the owner address in the flow (`test@appmixer.ai`). There is no API to delete the request; it expires when nobody activates it within 48 hours. Run this flow only against RoomPriceGenie's **development** environment, only when the component changed, and tell RoomPriceGenie that accounts named \"Appmixer E2E Test Hotel\" are test data.\n\nThe component uses the Partner API Key of the connector configuration and needs no connected account."
        }
    },
